          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l001",
            "text": "[Плач Йосифа в рові.] Въвръженномуже быв'шоу Іѡсифоу",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              944,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 22,
                "language": "uk",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": false,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              },
              {
                "start": 22,
                "end": 52,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l002",
            "text": "въ ровъ поустыни, гръкыми слезами и плачем лютым плакашес[я],",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              979,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 61,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l003",
            "text": "гор'ко самого ѡца҃ плачася гл҃юща съ въздыханїи незрѣлными:",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1015,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l004",
            "text": "„призри, ѡч҃е Іякове, на приключшєєся чаду твоему! ꙗко се въ ровъ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1051,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 65,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l005",
            "text": "въвръженъ есмь ꙗко мрт҃въ. се сам чаєши мене възвратитис[я]",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1087,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l006",
            "text": "къ тебѣ, ѡч҃е, и нн҃ѣ лежоу въ ровѣ ꙗкож[е] разбоинник. Сам,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1122,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 60,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l007",
            "text": "ѡч҃е, реклъ еси мнѣ: иди, посѣти братїю свою и стад[а] и възвра-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1158,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 64,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l008",
            "text": "тися къ мнѣ скоро! и се тїи ꙗко влъци сверѣпи быша и съ гнѣ-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1194,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 60,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l009",
            "text": "вомъ разлучиша мя ѿ тебе, добрыи мои ѡч҃е. оуже бо не има-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1230,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l010",
            "text": "еши мене видѣти ни гласа моего слышати, ни паки старост[ь]",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1265,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l011",
            "text": "твоя подсбрится мною, ни паки и азъ прпд҃бных твоих сѣдин",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1301,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 57,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l012",
            "text": "не оузрю, ꙗко горе мрт҃выца погрѣбен есмь азъ. плачися, ѡч҃[е],",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1337,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 63,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "joseph-lament-in-pit-l013",
            "text": "чада своего и чадо ѡча҃ [sic! зам. ѡца҃] си, ꙗкож[е] издѣт'ска",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              183,
              1373,
              944,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "start": 0,
                "end": 25,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "text_version": "gpt62-i201-first-image-20261125"
              },
              {
